    pageUrl: "https://listenaminute.com/h/hands.html",
    fullTranscript: `Hands are interesting things. They can do so many things. We'd be lost without them. I think hands are one of the most useful parts of the body. They are so clever. We can do so many different things with our hands. We can hold things, squeeze things, feel things. We can swing on jungle gyms, write and type letters; the list is endless. I think hands are a very beautiful part of the body, if they are well looked after. It's interesting to see how many different parts there are to our hands. We have a palm, fingers, knuckles, life lines, fingertips and the back of our hand. There are lots of good things you can do with your hands. I like holding hands, of course with my wife and children.`,
